<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys on-market at NZ$7.03/05.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys on-market at NZ$7.03/05.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corporation of New Zealand said on Wednesday that, as part of its NZ$1.0 billion share buyback programme, it had acquired 400,000 shares on market at per-share prices between NZ$7.03 and $7.05.</p>
<p>The largest block was of 300,000 shares bought at $7.05, close to the share's intraday trading high of $7.07.</p>
<p>By the close of trade Telecom had slipped back to $7.00.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom +64 4 473 4746</p>
</text>
